# Measurement tools (scripts/) and the suite (tests/): nothing the bot runs imports
# either -- tests/test_layout.py enforces that -- and both are used against a
# bind-mounted repo, so the image does not need them.
#
# Docs the bot doesn't read. README.md carries the regeneration commands (and so names
# the tools above); protoss_data_live.md is the cost/build-time table for the retail
# patch. Both are ROOT-anchored, so docker/README.md and the other reference/*.md stay.
builds/
reference/protoss_data_live.md
README.md
scripts/
tests/

